WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.650
Today you decide which root each word carries:

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:05.660
see, or look.

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:09.210
Then sort the sound alike words by the job they do.

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:14.820
Does the word show who owns something, name a thing, or squeeze two words together?

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:17.630
Then five new words in the spyglass.
